/-- Private Part002 backport of the scalar conditional-MGF adapter family.

Candidate audit: searched Part002, SOptLib/Glue probability and martingale helpers,
and Mathlib/LeanSearch for conditional MGF, fractional-power conditional Jensen,
and the sharp `exp x <= x + exp (9*x^2/16)` scalar domination.  The available
